  "title": "Crunchy Pumpkin Pie Granola",
  "description": "A big bowl of granola is a great way to start your day. In this crunchy version, sweetened rolled oats and nuts are mixed with pumpkin pie spice, baked until crispy, and tossed with dried fruit.",
